Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.77,0:00:04.53,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}3 MILLION CHANNEL SUBSCRIBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.36,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}CELEBRATION EVENT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.36,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.75,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko, everyone! I'm Ikonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:18.58,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:22.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming to my three \Nmillion subs celebration concert today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:27.67,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I even got a new outfit just for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you recognize this pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,So much has happened on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It was hard and I wanted to \Nquit so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.51,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,Ikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:43.13,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:45.46,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,There's a reason \NI've stuck with it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.04,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.03,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,I know you're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:51.03,Main,SIGN A,0,0,0,,{\an8}IT'S ALL YOUR FAULT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.08,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.88,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Bye-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.79,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS STREAM HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:32.09,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Things are looking up lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.38,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON CHAT STREAM!\NSUMERAGI IKON - 32.2K SUBSCRIBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.38,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,My sub count is growing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,With this number, I can easily \Nbe considered a top VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.95,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Huh? You landed tickets \Nto the Blue Box concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:42.85,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Blue Box? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:46.60,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Huh? They're the number one \NVTuber group in Japan, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:51.36,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Their biggest star, Momotose Ao, \Nrecently crossed three million subs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.93,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,VTubers doing concerts \Nin Chiba Messe? Sign of the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.99,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Three million...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,At my current pace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.09,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,it'll take around a century \Nfor me to hit three million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:08.50,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I actually the furthest one \Nfrom her dream out of all four of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.51,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-Wh-What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:14.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna be the black sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:21.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I have no doubt Rikka, Nene, and Shinobu \Nwill make their dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:22.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll get left behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:27.03,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I never would've had\Nthese thoughts before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:29.95,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What's gotten into me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Meowrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kirino?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:42.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:48.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She can execute a good tackle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:49.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's your takeaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't be satisfied with the status quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:56.95,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get more popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:00.84,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO - 3 MILLION SUBSCRIBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:00.84,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Momotose Ao, one of \Nthe biggest VTubers around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:05.74,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,She's what I should strive to be. \NI gotta catch up to her quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll do some research into her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,and figure out what I'm lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:16.31,Main,AO,0,0,0,,Welcome to my three million subs \Ncelebration concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.74,Main,AO,0,0,0,,I hope you all enjoy yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:22.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,She's such a good dancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:28.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Her 3D model is pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.90,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,and the effects are out of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:34.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wait, it's too early for me to go 3D.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:37.43,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I should focus on her regular streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:40.11,Main,AO,0,0,0,,I'm making macarons today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.18,Main,AO,0,0,0,,I hear it's hard even for pros, \Nbut I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.97,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}PIANO STREAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.85,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}VTUBER TACKLES CENTRALIZED COLLEGE ENTRANCE EXAM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:46.85,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:50.92,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I do a wide variety of content too, \Nbut she's on a different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's not fair that she's smart, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:55.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, stop getting cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.91,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gotta outdo Ao-chan in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.91,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MUNDEY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:07.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A notification for Kirino's stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:10.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A cooking stream? Now that's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:10.21,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}COOKING STREAM!\NSUMERAGI IKON
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:14.59,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko! \NI'm gonna try baking a cake today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.96,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Here's what I'm making.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.63,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,A special four-tier cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:24.18,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,No VTuber's ever done this before. \NLet's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:27.35,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,First, open this pack \Nof superfine sugar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:30.65,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Uh, where's the mixer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.06,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WHAT DO I WATCH?\NWHERE'S THE HANDCAM?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:35.13,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Body temperature? \NHow do I figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:37.56,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,How do I preheat an oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:40.87,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,A heatproof bowl? There are \Nbowls that aren't heatproof?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:43.66,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have a handcam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:46.20,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,so you can't see what I'm doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.33,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS LIVESTREAM HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.33,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Bye-Iko for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What is she doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:52.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Chat is confused as heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:52.21,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUGAR UNPACKING STREAM\NF FOR STREAM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:53.46,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}HOME EC. ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:53.46,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That was a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:06:00.42,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But I can't beat Ao-chan \Nunless I one-up her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:08.97,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}CHOOSEDEY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:06.05,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.97,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm playing an instrument called \Nthe didgeridoo today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.48,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WHENSDEY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.48,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll get a perfect score on \Na Tokyo U mock exam today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:14.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIRSTDEY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:14.56,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll keep singing until \NI hit three million subs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FRYDEY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.56,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Good morning, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:22.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We need to talk—hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:23.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:27.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,'Cause you're gonna yell at me! \NJust leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,If I don't do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:31.17,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I won't be able to beat Ao-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:41.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ao-chan, huh? I see how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.30,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bucky'll definitely try \Nto stop me if I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:50.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}He'll say, "There's no way you \Ncould ever beat Momotose Ao."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:53.08,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gotta figure this out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.53,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I have to do to beat Ao-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ao-chan's streaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:01.53,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO NEW OUTFIT\NKINDA SEXY <3
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:01.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:03.18,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.74,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FEW DAYS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.91,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}IKON NEW OUTFIT DEBUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Iko's doing a new outfit stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.71,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's pretty sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So she hasn't come to club because \Nshe's been busy drawing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:21.46,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NEW OUTFIT DEBUT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:21.14,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's always fun trying to figure out \Nwhat it looks like from the silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:25.96,Broadcast,IKON,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:31.47,Broadcast,IKON,0,0,0,,What do you think of my new outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:32.26,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,A swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, that's steamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.60,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Is she really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.02,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}VIEWERS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.03,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Look at that viewer count go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.68,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Maybe because I made it way \Nmore risque than Ao-chan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.23,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WOW, IKON!\NI COULD WATCH THIS FOREVER.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:46.03,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Th-This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.08,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:48.41,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}JUMP FOR US!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.41,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,You want me to jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.62,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll jump for mew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, she's jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:56.58,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, they actually bounce and sway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:59.43,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Uh, it's still going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:02.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The angle of her neck went all wonky, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Did something go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What in the world are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:11.55,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm streaming! Give it back right meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:15.87,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't beat Ao-chan in anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:18.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't catch up unless I do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:20.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. I can't say I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to play catch-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:29.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You already have what it takes \Nto be a top VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:30.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:34.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm not lying. Yours truly would \Nnever lie to comfort somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You've fried your brain over this, right? \NJust leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:46.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,After all, you're not at all \Ninferior to Momotose Ao.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:51.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay. Help, Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:55.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sure thing! You can count on yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hmm? You noticed, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.80,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just how perfect my skin is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.93,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm saying it's too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:08.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You gave that cool speech earlier, Bucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:11.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,but do you really think \NI can beat Ao-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:13.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A Yamabuki never flatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You do have that potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:18.64,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How? She's better than me at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:19.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:23.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,First of all, I love your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:24.50,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,L-Love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A VTuber's voice is one of \Ntheir most valuable assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:31.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,O-Oh, right, yeah. My voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Visuals, voice, creativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Naturally, you won't gain popularity \Nif you're lacking in any of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:39.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but personally, voice is \Nthe most important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:44.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,With long streams, people do other stuff \Nwhile watching them on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:48.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It becomes an audio-only \Nexperience at that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:51.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and if they don't like your voice, \Nthey can't listen to it for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,On that note, you have \Na low-key angelic voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's calming and I can \Nlisten to it all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That alone is a top-tier \Ntalent for a VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:05.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I believe that your voice \Nis superior to Momotose Ao's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:06.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Slow down on the praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:09.16,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm literally clenching \Nmy cheeks right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:12.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't flatter. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:16.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,However, having a great voice \Nmeans nothing without reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:20.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's where collaborating \Nwith bigger streamers comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:24.68,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SURPRISE COLLAB] TAKOYAKI PARTY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:24.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You should join \Ntheir livestreams as a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:28.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Once people hear your voice, \Nthey're sure to take an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:29.98,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Would anyone even collab with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:35.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I looked into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:38.95,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'LL DM THE VTUBERS I WANT FOR THAT ONE EVENT! PLEASE DON'T IGNORE IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:38.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is Konpiler, a VTuber \Nwith over 150k subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's recruiting participants \Non social media for an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:43.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What's this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:46.46,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RESULTS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:46.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Speedrunning a horror game, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:52.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's personally contacting VTubers \Nwho post a good time on stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What do you say to giving it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's the spirit. Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'll need time to practice the game, \Nso let's do the stream one week from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:08.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Regardless of the results, \NI'm proud of you for trying new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,In the past, you only \Never did chat streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.15,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,A dream where my dream came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh? What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:22.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.25,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Phweh! Phweh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:26.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Grr! How vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I won't tell you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.01,Main,SIGN B,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'LL SHOW YOU SOMEDAY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.97,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ONE WEEK LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.97,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:42.14,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Today, I'm doing the horror game \Nspeedrun that's been trending online.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm nervous because it's my first time \Nstreaming a horror game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:48.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is a super short game...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:52.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've watched most of Kirino's gaming \Nstreams, and she's got skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:56.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a typical FPS where you \Nshoot zombies down as you advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:58.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}The genre she's best at.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:01.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's highly likely she'll get \Npicked for the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go, Kirino! Shoot those zombies \Nfor the sake of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:11.84,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll take this gun here, craft \Nsome healing items in advance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.34,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,and trigger this trap here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:16.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll dodge it with a roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:18.72,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's the type to move while gaming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:23.10,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's making good time. \NShe'll be fine if she keeps this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stay away, you stupid zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.73,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh no! I'm gonna get eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:38.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,My bloodline will end with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.57,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let go of your controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:44.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Didn't you practice for this? \NHere, controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.54,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I just can't handle horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:51.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You hit me right in the philtrum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:55.30,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't! I'm gonna wet myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,If I wet myself, that's the end of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yikes, Yamabuki-kun's making \NIko play a horror game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.05,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wow, what an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:06.06,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Iko's allergy to horror is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:14.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well, you got a bunch of comments \Nand gained subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm not getting that \Ncollab invite, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:19.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Not if you can't play the game, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:24.35,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Then it's all meaningless. \NYou helped me out, but I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:27.30,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How could I fail so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Everyone has strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:32.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's my bad for not checking \Nwith you. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:38.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I said I'd show you my dream, \Nbut I don't think I'll ever be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:42.98,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You gave me all that praise, \Nbut I just had to go screw it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:51.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. The VTuber world \Nsure is fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:57.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Kirino, why do you think the amateur \NKoshien is more popular than pro baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.16,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Lots of people with a shaved head fetish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No more ridiculous theories, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:04.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The efforts of the young players, \Nthe drama leading up to the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:07.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,the twists and turns caused \Nby their inexperience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:12.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Skills and mastery alone \Ncan't move a person's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That goes for VTubers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:16.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If your efforts and feelings \Nmake an impression,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,people will fall in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:21.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sometimes, even your flaws \Ncan be an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,They can?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:27.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A compilation video \Nof your stream is trending!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:27.68,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No way! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON STREAM COMPILATION - 270K VIEWS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:31.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your over-the-top freakout \Nmust've gone over well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:35.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You made an impression precisely \Nbecause of your dislike of horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:39.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Konpiler may very well take notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:46.24,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, so it was okay to be a scaredy-cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What kinda clips did \Nthat compilation have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:49.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Want to watch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:52.04,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ROOKIE VTUBER WETS HERSELF FROM FEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:54.21,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't wet myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well, thumbnails need to be eye-catching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:59.24,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No way I'm getting invited now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Never say never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:05.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,See? Your phone's buzzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Maybe Konpiler has sent you an invite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:10.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Meow! Like heck it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO COLLAB INVITATION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:13.56,Main,SIGN C,0,0,0,,{\an8}A BOLT FROM THE BLUE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.06,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO COLLAB INVITATION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What do I do, Bucky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:18.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,C-C-Calm down, Kirino!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:21.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a collab invite from \Nthe top VTuber Momotose Ao!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:25.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}We get to interact with that \Nthree-million-sub monster so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:28.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even yours truly can't help \Nbut be thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:30.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is our chance to make \NKirino known across Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:34.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't just collab \Nwith Ao-chan right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Read it closely! \NYou'll just be one of many at first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:41.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The Ao Cup is a game tourney \Nwith over 50 VTubers taking part,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:45.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and the cream of the crop \Nwill get to challenge her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:49.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Only when you get past the qualifiers \Nwill you interact with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:53.47,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This edition of the Ao Cup is \Na Meow Drive racing tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm real good at this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:56.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:16:00.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Conquer the prelims and get \Nsome screentime with Momotose Ao!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.90,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:03.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,My hyper best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay, time for some special training!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:11.41,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FEW DEYS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:15.57,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Hell-ao! The Ao Cup is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:19.33,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,We'll have heated battles in order \Nto challenge me one-on-one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:22.29,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,We've got familiar faces \Nas well as dark-horse newbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.87,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,None of the races are staged, \Nso cheer them all on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:29.30,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Now, let me announce \Nthe groups for the prelims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.09,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I-It's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.74,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,First off, we have the special Group A.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.48,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,This group is where we quarantine \Nall the problem children!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.66,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,They've been blacklisted \Nby other agencies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:48.03,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,or are so problematic, they have \Nbanhammers hanging right over their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:51.16,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Even among them, keep an eye out for...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.91,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Sumeragi Ikon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:56.58,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,She's a super problematic VTuber \Nwho wet herself on a stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I didn't wet myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:02.04,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did she invite Kirino as a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.42,Broadcast,SANS,0,0,0,,Hey, am I gonna get a reward for winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:08.42,Broadcast,BANE,0,0,0,,Give me all your subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:11.76,Broadcast,MARO,0,0,0,,I'll give you a kiss if you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:13.97,Broadcast,BANE,0,0,0,,Don't want it, uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:17.51,Broadcast,SANS,0,0,0,,I'd rather get a kiss from Ikon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:21.15,Broadcast,BANE,0,0,0,,Ikon-chan's kissing face \Nin three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:22.68,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:24.40,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Mwah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:27.63,Broadcast,BANE,0,0,0,,She's uggo, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:29.33,Broadcast,SANS,0,0,0,,This is her kissing face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.91,Broadcast,MARO,0,0,0,,Are you taking \Na leak right now, Ikon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:35.62,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't have many expressions. \NThis is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:38.53,Broadcast,SANS,0,0,0,,You're not fooling anybody! \NYou're taking the piss for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:43.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kirino gains nothing from \Nhanging around this vulgar bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.55,0:17:45.89,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:49.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kirino, just focus on winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:54.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's to show them the fruits \Nof all your practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.02,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ded...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.03,Broadcast,BANE,0,0,0,,Bwahaha, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:03.52,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON - 4TH PLACE OUT OF 4
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:04.04,Broadcast,SANS,0,0,0,,You just got lucky with the items!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:08.91,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sorry, Bucky. I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:12.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It is what it is. Contests can \Nbe decided by luck at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.87,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,We'll have to bid farewell \Nto all the people who lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:18.25,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,The winners, please move \Nto this waiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:22.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yours truly lost? Not to mention \Nwe were dead last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:25.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've researched the game more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:30.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, before that, I should've \Nforeseen this kind of treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:32.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}What an utter disgrace I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:35.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Yamabuki is supposed to be \Nno less than perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:42.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kirino. This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:43.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.85,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,They were so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:48.21,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't believe how good they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:53.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sure, I wasn't able to talk to Ao-chan, \Nbut I'm glad I got to be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:57.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, Kirino, don't you hate \Nhow you were treated?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:19:00.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was frustrating \Nthat I couldn't get back at them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:07.71,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm happy that our hard work \Ngot us such a big stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:13.34,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It made me believe that together, we can \Nmake even more amazing things happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:18.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've never thought of it that way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:21.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It seems I was too fixated on results.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:24.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's most important is \Nthat you had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:26.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well? Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:27.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:30.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good to hear. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:33.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't let those jerks get away \Nwith the crap they gave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:37.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How dare they hurt my Kirino \Nright in front of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:40.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And Momotose Ao invited you and \Ndidn't even interact with you! How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen up, Kirino!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:44.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We're trying again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll make direct \Ncontact with Momotose Ao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:52.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Say, Bucky, did you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:54.46,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:59.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ao-chan's calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:59.26,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:01.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?! Let me have a word with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:04.51,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No, Bucky! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:08.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:11.40,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:11.40,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Momotose Ao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:15.80,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,I'm actually contacting all the entrants, \Nso I'm sorry I couldn't call you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.24,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's t-t-totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:22.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It was s-s-such an honor \Nto have you invite me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:24.08,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:28.43,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,I put you in that group \Nbecause I thought it'd be funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.66,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,but they took it a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:36.05,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I really didn't mind! I-I'd love to \Ncollab with you again one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:37.97,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,I'll reach out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:39.98,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Just like this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.90,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,I hope you'll bring your advisor with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.35,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,The reason you've grown so much lately
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:48.29,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,is because you have \Na capable brain behind you, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:51.32,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,I'd love to speak to your \Nadvisor directly next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.82,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MOMOTOSE AO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:54.77,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,See you then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:55.78,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}CALL ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:58.62,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bucky! How'd she know about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:20:59.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.53,0:21:03.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Was she able to detect my involvement \Njust from the content of the videos?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:07.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So this is what the top \Nof the top VTuber is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:11.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:14.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But one day, I'll surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kirino?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:21.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You really caught me \Noff guard back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:22.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:27.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, that face...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So was that a k...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:38.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is my "I wanna use \Nthe restroom" face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:39.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:43.32,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You made my heart race a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:46.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,"How dare they hurt my Kirino," you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Forgive me! It was a rush \Nof blood to the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was a slip of the tongue! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:57.57,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.49,0:22:00.88,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Like you said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:05.85,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,there won't be so much distance \Nbetween us next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main,SIGN D,0,0,0,,{\an8}WE'LL MAKE DIRECT CONTACT
